cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "grounded-matsci: Grounded verification of materials-chemistry reasoning"
abstract: >-
  Large language models confabulate chemical and materials objects --- molecular
  formulas, space groups, formation energies --- inside fluent reasoning traces,
  most often for the long-tail entities where verification matters most. We build
  a tiered, deterministic verifier that grounds each extractable claim against
  authoritative databases and physics, and study it across four current models on
  528 condition-pinned prompts.
